# Source distribution manifest.
#
# The *wheel* is constrained by `[tool.setuptools] packages = ["pygments_step"]`,
# so it never carries tests or docs. The *sdist*, however, is built by setuptools
# from a file manifest, and with no MANIFEST.in its default template also sweeps
# in project test sources (that is why tests/ used to appear in the sdist, even
# though the fixtures did not). This file pins the sdist down to the package plus
# the standard metadata, and prunes development-only content.

include README.md
include LICENSE
include CHANGELOG.md
include pyproject.toml

# Development-only content stays out of the source distribution.
prune tests
prune docs
prune .github
prune .venv
prune dist
